\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sl396\slmult1\tx360\tx720\b0\f1\fs22 We tried to make this game template in such a way where even a non-technical folk also can modify and publish this game. But for the techie who wants to make a detailed modification or wants to add more features, below is few notes that may help you understand structure and workflow of this asset.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}This game is entirely made with uGUI including gameplay.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}\b\f3 Game Controller\b0\f1 : This controller is responsible for all gameplay. Any gameplay behavior and events can be modified in this controller.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}\b\f3 NumberedBrick\b0\f1 : This script controls appearance, animation and movement of tile.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}\b\f3 UserProgress\b0\f1 : This controller handles Current Score, Top Score and Game State. Mostly you won't need to touch this controller unless you want to add any more user data and save it.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}\b\f3 SfxButton\b0\f1 : This script sets Audio Mixer Snapshots and saves them.\par

